      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Caelid 1 in one of the buildings in the Street of Sages Ruins , in Aeonia Swamp . 1 south of the Commander O'Neil boss fight arena. (It's a glowing ball on the ground, not insects flying in the air.) 1 southwest of the Heart of Aeonia site of grace (in the Commander O'Neil boss fight arena). 7 near the Inner Aeonia site of grace: 5 south, 1 north, and 1 west. 3 in and around the Church of the Plague . 1 east of the Astray from Caelid Highway North site of grace, in the swamp. [ Map link ] 1 in the northeast of Sellia, Town of Sorcery . 14 in the Abandoned Cave .; Altus Plateau 2 in a turret in The Shaded Castle , which requires jumping from a wall in the area that contains the elevator tower, just before the boss.; Ainsel River 3 on the cliff that overlooks the Lake of Rot.",
